<title>UK: UK M4 grows final 11.2 pct in yr-on-yr in February.</title>
<headline>UK M4 grows final 11.2 pct in yr-on-yr in February.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England published the following data on UK monetary aggregates for February -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY			     Feb    pvs rptd  Jan</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (adjusted)	1.4	 1.4    1.7</p>
<p>     n year to date (adjusted)	   11.2     11.3   10.0</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (unadjusted)     1.6	1.6    0.6</p>
<p>	 in year to date (unadjusted)    11.3     11.3    9.9</p>
<p>Adjusted lending by banks, building</p>
<p>    societies in billions of stg	  8.2	8.2   13.1</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
